TITLE:: ProbeVectorscope
summary:: Real-time stereo vectorscope and phase correlation meter
categories:: GUI>Visuals
related:: Classes/Probe, Classes/ProbeScope, Classes/ProbeDashboard

DESCRIPTION::
ProbeVectorscope provides a real-time stereo Lissajous vectorscope and phase correlation meter.
It features native hardware-accelerated X/Y plotting via ScopeView overlaid with a 45-degree Mid/Side polar graticule,
a real-time stereo phase correlation gauge [-1.0, +1.0], and stereo energy balance readout.

list::
## strong::Lissajous X/Y Display::: Left channel on X axis, Right channel on Y axis at audio rate via ScopeOut2.
## strong::Mid/Side Overlay::: 45-degree rotated polar crosshairs showing Mono (+M) vs Stereo Side (+S).
## strong::Phase Correlation Gauge::: Running correlation from +1.0 (pure mono) through 0.0 (wide stereo) to -1.0 (anti-phase cancellation warning).
## strong::Stereo Balance Indicator::: Left/Right energy balance readout.
## strong::Broker Subscription::: Shares analysis sources with other active visualizers.
::

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
Creates and displays a new ProbeVectorscope window.

ARGUMENT:: server
The target link::Classes/Server:: (defaults to code::Server.default::).

ARGUMENT:: busIndex
Audio bus offset (default 0).

ARGUMENT:: theme
Theme name symbol (e.g. code::\graphite::) or link::Classes/ProbeTheme:: instance.

ARGUMENT:: updateFreq
Telemetry update rate in Hz (default 15 Hz).

METHOD:: view
Embed the vectorscope into a custom parent link::Classes/View:: or link::Classes/Window::.

ARGUMENT:: parent
Parent view or window.

ARGUMENT:: bounds
Dimensions and position as link::Classes/Rect::.

ARGUMENT:: server
Target link::Classes/Server::.

ARGUMENT:: busIndex
Audio bus offset.

ARGUMENT:: theme
Visual theme.

ARGUMENT:: updateFreq
Telemetry update rate in Hz.

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: window
Returns the underlying link::Classes/Window::.

METHOD:: vectorscopeView
Returns the underlying PB_VectorscopeView composite view.

METHOD:: theme
Update active theme dynamically across the vectorscope display.

ARGUMENT:: aTheme
Theme symbol or link::Classes/ProbeTheme::.

METHOD:: fontScale
Get or set the active typography scaling factor.

ARGUMENT:: aScale
Float font scale between 0.6 and 2.5.

METHOD:: toggleFreeze
Toggle pause/unpause of the vectorscope.

METHOD:: close
Close window and release broker subscriptions.

EXAMPLES::

code::
s.boot;
x = { [SinOsc.ar(220) * 0.3, SinOsc.ar(222) * 0.3] }.play;
v = Probe.vectorscope(s, 0, \graphite);
::
